      "reply": "**Given**  \n$R = 0.2\\,\\mathrm{m}$  \n$r = 0.04\\,\\mathrm{m}$\n\n**Find**  \n$MA$\n\n**Formula**  \n$MA = \\frac{R}{r}$ — Ideal mechanical advantage of a wheel and axle  \nAssumes friction is neglected.\n\n**Substitution**  \n$MA = \\frac{0.2}{0.04}$\n\n**Answer**\n\n```answer\n5\n```\n"
