    "incline_sliding": {
      "question": "For the 12 kg crate on a 30 degree incline with μs = 0.45 and μk = 0.30, does it start sliding?",
      "answer": "Yes, it starts sliding.",
      "reply": "**Given**  \n$\\theta = 30^\\circ$  \n$g = 9.81\\,\\mathrm{m/s²}$  \n$\\mu_s = 0.45$  \n$m = 12\\,\\mathrm{kg}$\n\n**Find**  \n$\\text{Will it start sliding?}$\n\n**Formula**  \n$F_{g,\\parallel}=mg\\sin\\theta$ — Static-friction threshold  \n$f_{s,\\max} = \\mu_sN$  \n$f_{s,\\max} = \\mu_smg\\cos\\theta$\n$F_{g,\\parallel}>f_{s,\\max} \\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad mg\\sin\\theta>\\mu_smg\\cos\\theta$\n\n**Substitution**  \n$F_{g,\\parallel} = 12\\cdot9.81\\cdot\\sin(30^\\circ)$  \n$F_{g,\\parallel} \\approx 58.86\\,\\text{N}$\n$f_{s,\\max} = 0.45\\cdot12\\cdot9.81\\cdot\\cos(30^\\circ)$  \n$f_{s,\\max} \\approx 45.88\\,\\text{N}$\n$58.86\\,\\text{N} > 45.88\\,\\text{N}$\n\n**Answer**\n\n```answer\n\\text{Yes, it starts sliding.}\n```\n"
    },
    "projectile_parts": {
      "question": "A projectile is launched at 20 m/s at 30 degrees. Find the time of flight, the maximum height and the range.",
      "answer": "t_flight = 2.04 s; H_max = 5.1 m; R = 35.3 m",
      "reply": "**Given**  \n$v_0 = 20\\,\\mathrm{m/s}$  \n$\\theta = 30^\\circ$  \n$g = 9.81\\,\\mathrm{m/s²}$\n\n**Find**  \n$t_{flight}$\n\n**Formula**  \n$t = \\frac{2 v_0 \\sin(\\theta)}{g}$ — Projectile-motion equation  \n$H = h_0 + \\frac{v_0^2 \\sin^2(\\theta)}{2g}$  \n$R = \\frac{v_0^2 \\sin(2\\theta)}{g}$\n\n**Substitution**  \n$t_{flight} = \\frac{2 \\cdot 20 \\cdot \\sin(30^\\circ)}{9.81}$  \n$H_{max} = 0 + \\frac{20^2 \\sin^2(30^\\circ)}{2 \\cdot 9.81}$  \n$R = \\frac{20^{2} \\cdot \\sin(30^\\circ \\cdot 2)}{9.81}$\n\n**Answer**\n\n```answer\nt_{\\mathrm{flight}} = 2.04\\,\\mathrm{s};\\quad H_{\\mathrm{max}} = 5.1\\,\\mathrm{m};\\quad R = 35.3\\,\\mathrm{m}\n```\n\n```graph\n{\"type\":\"trajectory\",\"expr\":\"y(x) = x*tan(30.0 deg) - g*x^2/(2*v0^2*cos^2(theta))\",\"variable\":\"x\",\"x_min\":0.0,\"x_max\":37.07754022318697,\"domain_explicit\":false,\"x\":null,\"y_min\":null,\"y_max\":null,\"a\":null,\"b\":null,\"c\":null,\"comparator\":null,\"title\":\"Projectile Trajectory\",\"points\":[[0.0,0.0],[0.35668629363335225,0.20385279706318835],[0.7133725872667045,0.4035453329618218],[1.0700588809000569,0.5990776076959005],[1.426745174533409,0.7904496212654242],[1.7834314681667613,0.9776613736703931],[2.1401177618001137,1.1607128649108072],[2.496804055433466,1.3396040949866663],[2.853490349066818,1.5143350638979707],[3.2101766427001706,1.68490577164472],[3.5668629363335227,1.8513162182269145],[3.923549229966875,2.013566403644554],[4.280235523600227,2.1716563278976393],[4.6369218172335795,2.3255859909861694],[4.993608110866932,2.4753553929101444],[5.350294404500284,2.620964533669565],[5.706980698133636,2.76241341326443],[6.063666991766989,2.89970203169474],[6.420353285400341,3.032830388960496],[6.777039579033693,3.1617984850616967],[7.133725872667045,3.286606319998343],[7.4904121663003975,3.407253893770434],[7.84709845993375,3.52374120637797],[8.203784753567103,3.636068257820951],[8.560471047200455,3.7442350480993776],[8.917157340833807,3.8482415772132494],[9